Speaker 1: Social murder rather than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:22.560
genocide. Interesting. Okay.
Speaker 2: But. Back to my question,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:31.740
I guess, please. Recently, Joe Biden and Eric&nbsp;
Adams. You know how they've pivoted on crime.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:36.349
Kind of like the nineties. Tough&nbsp;
on crime era coming back again.&nbsp;

00:00:36.349 --> 00:00:41.100
Speaker 1: I know Eric Adams did did Trump as&nbsp;
well. I'm not I'm sorry. Did Biden as well?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:46.020
I'm not aware of that. What did Biden do?
