detrimental in the way that you're talking about.&nbsp;

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:14.160
Speaker 2: Okay. Well, that's all I got.
Speaker 1: All right. Thank you so much.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:17.460
